<view class="container"><view class="card"><view class="title">我的购物车</view><view wx:if="{{!ready}}" class="description">会员登录及接口尚未接通，暂不能下单或支付。</view><block wx:else><button bindtap="loadCart" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">刷新购物车</button><view wx:if="{{!rows.length}}">暂无购物车数据，请刷新。</view><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="productId" class="description">{{item.name || item.productCode}} × {{item.quantity}} · {{item.selected ? '已选' : '未选'}} · {{item.sellable ? item.unitPrice : '不可售'}} 元<view><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.productId}}" data-kind="select" bindtap="changeCart" disabled="{{loading || pending}}">{{item.selected ? '取消勾选' : '勾选'}}</button><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.productId}}" data-kind="minus" bindtap="changeCart" disabled="{{loading || pending || item.quantity &lt;= 1}}">−</button><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.productId}}" data-kind="plus" bindtap="changeCart" disabled="{{loading || pending || item.quantity >= 999}}">＋</button><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.productId}}" bindtap="deleteCart" disabled="{{loading || pending}}">删除</button></view></view><button bindtap="preview" disabled="{{loading || pending}}">预览已选商品结算（暂不选券）</button><view wx:if="{{quote}}">商品金额 {{quote.originalAmount}} 元，优惠 {{quote.discountAmount}} 元，应付 {{quote.payableAmount}} 元</view><view wx:if="{{pending}}">上次提交结果未确认，请用原请求重试；不会使用新报价替换原请求。</view><button bindtap="submit" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading || (!quote &amp;&amp; !pending)}}">{{pending ? '重试原请求' : '确认提交订单'}}</button><view wx:if="{{receipt}}">订单 {{receipt.orderNo}} · {{receipt.status}} · 应付 {{receipt.payableAmount}} 元。尚未接通支付。<button bindtap="refreshOrder" disabled="{{loading}}">刷新订单状态</button></view></block><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view>
